    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάρα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰμᾰ</span>], 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάρη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trench, conduit, channel,</i> for watering meadows, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερσὶ μάκελλαν ἔχων, ἀμάρης ἐξ
					ἔχματα βάλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.259
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρηναῖαι ἀμάραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1392
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλλεις εἰς ἀμάραν με</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					27.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				151
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				50.106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hollow</i> of ear, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				77.23
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
